{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you woke up from a coma, you found yourself in a space that seemed to be in an infinite loop, and you realized that this place was extremely eerie and terrifying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have discovered that the only way to escape from here is to determine whether there is an anomaly in each cycle of the space here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All kinds of strange things kept happening during this period. In the darkness, it seemed as if something was peeping at you, preventing you from leaving here</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eerie Dossier:the Haunted Apartment&quot;is a walking simulation game that combines horror and horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you discover something unusual during the game, please return to the original route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no abnormal situation is found, please continue to pass through the room door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some abnormal situations may be accompanied by special sound effects, which can be easily recognized by wearing headphones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 52 different abnormal situations in the game, some of which are relatively hidden and require careful observation to confirm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you will discover secrets hidden beneath various abnormal phenomena during the investigation process.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD\uff1aMove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift\uff1aRun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E\uff1aInteraction/Survey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F\uff1aTurn on/Turn off the flashlight\uff08After you obtain it\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc\uff1aMenu</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3941850/f83c38eac5b244a18f47c4e21bd77278a3dbe733.jpg"},{"name":"Haunted by nightmares","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3941850/627717544765c715ec824d36cd836aad75796d01.jpg"},{"name":"The story isn\u2019t over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3941850/715f9b376fc1da0c80ba83cc77ca6d0c87c7f1b8.jpg"},{"name":"Back to the start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3941850/ce2e2f27705555e5254e5055acce77f88a9e00c7.jpg"},{"name":"Step into darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3941850/cb7c08e6f5a6bcf1be5fe9abcb28107069c3dce0.jpg"},{"name":"Peering into another world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3941850/6c957a11e6c2982b652c561b10fb99f5bf2c892e.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941850?t=1773312876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941850/607129d121c6508f92f4a0cc1a9c211d1e2ca374/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773312876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941850/ee61cc043df35f978c6582bb01d4330c84553ba9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773312876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941850/ee61cc043df35f978c6582bb01d4330c84553ba9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773312876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blood and Ghosts."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you woke up from a coma, you found yourself in a space that seemed to be in an infinite loop, and you realized that this place was extremely eerie and terrifying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have discovered that the only way to escape from here is to determine whether there is an anomaly in each cycle of the space here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All kinds of strange things kept happening during this period. In the darkness, it seemed as if something was peeping at you, preventing you from leaving here</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eerie Dossier:the Haunted Apartment&quot;is a walking simulation game that combines horror and horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you discover something unusual during the game, please return to the original route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no abnormal situation is found, please continue to pass through the room door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some abnormal situations may be accompanied by special sound effects, which can be easily recognized by wearing headphones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 52 different abnormal situations in the game, some of which are relatively hidden and require careful observation to confirm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you will discover secrets hidden beneath various abnormal phenomena during the investigation process.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD\uff1aMove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift\uff1aRun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E\uff1aInteraction/Survey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F\uff1aTurn on/Turn off the flashlight\uff08After you obtain it\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc\uff1aMenu</p>","developers":["Gameloop","\u9690\u4e66\u5927\u5b85"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941850/a6972db3e38c7ac9b0d9ae65bb6cc8e98801f998/header.jpg?t=1773312876","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<stro